{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51829","headline":"送尹蔓回睦州 · 厉翼","name":"送尹蔓回睦州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君授衣月，远作泛舟行。\n江阔桐庐岸，山深建德城。\n千寻乔木影，七里暮滩声。\n兴尽当停櫂，临流更濯缨。\n（《严陵集》二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}